'''OpTic Gaming''' is an [[:Category:United States|American]] esports organization primarily known for its ''[[callofduty:OpTic Gaming|Call of Duty]]'' team. On June 12, 2019, the organization was acquired by [[Immortals|Immortals Gaming Club]]. <ref name="IGC">{{cite web|url=https://esportsinsider.com/2019/06/immortals-acquires-optic-gaming|date=2019-06-12|title=Immortals officially acquires Infinite Esports & Entertainment|author=[[Adam Fitch]]|publisher=[[Esports Insider]]}}</ref> It was later reacquired by '''OpTic Gaming''''s founder Hector "H3CZ"  Rodriguez on November 11, 2020. <ref name="H3CZ reacquires OpTic">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/OpTic/status/1326570392006307850|date=2020-11-11|title=ANNOUNCEMENT|author='''OpTic Gaming'''}}</ref>

